WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.416 --> 00:00:05.500
-Ah to be the number one hero is a bore. 

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.375
I'm going to take some time off.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:09.791
Austin Reaves...come amuse me. 

00:00:12.791 --> 00:00:14.000
-Things haven't been the same

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.791
since the mandatory minutes rule.

00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:18.750
-You there, you better not be resting!

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:21.000
-We’re finally all together-

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.166
but we couldn’t feel further apart.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.958
-Initiate trash talk sequence:

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.250
you missed the bucket, Westbrook.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.166
-Disrespect my family name again and I'll unplug your a-

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.875
-We’re not resting, I swear.

00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:35.916
No, I still have a few good years left!

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.416
What the...?

00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:44.541
-It’s Joker vs. Luka in Match 1.

00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:45.625
-[Chuckle].

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:49.750
-You monster! Now my homeland expects me a to win a title.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:51.375
Step back!

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:56.166
-If they keep adding tournament, I will keep winning tournament.

00:00:58.166 --> 00:00:58.958
-It can’t be. 

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.166
-Oh, and Scoot continues to not play like Dame.

00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:02.500
-Mitchell with the jab! Haliburton drives!

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.958
-The Golden State elders look lost in the Thunder cloud.

00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:06.458
-Steph, attack! 

00:01:06.458 --> 00:01:07.791
-Whose team do you think this is?

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.291
-Yo, ya'll the old men from the commercials!

00:01:10.291 --> 00:01:12.666
-You ain't never seen a joey this tall, eh mate?

00:01:12.666 --> 00:01:15.000
-What’s up fam? It's an honor for you to play with me.

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:17.875
-Oh, and Brunson looks alone out there!

00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:20.500
-So do you want to attack?

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:21.750
-No man, you can attack first.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:22.666
-Are you sure? I can-

00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:23.000
-No, you go.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.458
-Teamwork...must be nice...

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:28.500
-And the first rounds of the knockout stages are well underway

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.125
in the IN-SEASON TOURNAMENT!

00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:33.500
-The In-Season Tournament?

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.750
-Computing new information. 

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.250
-F**k yeah, a fight!

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.541
♪♪♪ [Theme Song] ♪♪♪

00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:04.875
-Remember: the winner of the In-Season Tournament 

00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:07.250
 will receive cash prizes.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:09.583
-Board man does get paid.

00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:11.458
-Pay me in revenge!

00:02:11.458 --> 00:02:15.625
-Future Inglewood vs. The Dallas Plains...commence battle!

00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:17.375
-A hero tournament. 

00:02:17.375 --> 00:02:19.916
Time to remind everyone about Playoff P.

00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:22.916
-Classic.

00:02:23.041 --> 00:02:24.833
-Another rough start for the Clippers.

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:27.833
-Yikes, and they think we're dysfunctional.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.791
-C'mon, Kyrie.

00:02:30.791 --> 00:02:34.375
-Dysfunctional? Man, why is everyone always talking shit about us?

00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:36.791
-Idea! We wait till later.

00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:40.041
-No! We go all out,

00:02:40.041 --> 00:02:41.041
put up huge stats,

00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:42.666
then run out of gas for the rest of the year.

00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:45.208
-You’ve got to take this regular season stuff seriously!

00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:46.916
-Man, Playoff P doesn't work.

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:48.333
It's just you but you glow a little.

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:52.416
-Incorrect. This is different?

00:02:52.416 --> 00:02:54.000
-The Clippers prepare for the Rockets.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.333
-Yeah, I'm the best ever.

00:02:56.833 --> 00:02:59.875
-Oh, Playoff P. I'm so scared.

00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:01.291
I'm not really scared, by the way.

00:03:01.291 --> 00:03:03.416
-I've learned to take the regular season

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:05.250
as seriously as playoff mountain. 

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.666
I'm now...

00:03:06.666 --> 00:03:09.500
In-Season Tournament P.

00:03:09.666 --> 00:03:10.250
-What?!

00:03:10.416 --> 00:03:11.791
-Bionic Kick.

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.666
-I refuse to believe I brought this on myself.

00:03:17.291 --> 00:03:20.625
-Now we enjoy the low stakes of in-season fighting.

00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:22.416
-Jokic throws….but George intercepts!

00:03:22.416 --> 00:03:24.041
-This is for the bubble!

00:03:24.041 --> 00:03:25.458
-Westbrook looking like his old self!

00:03:25.458 --> 00:03:26.833
-Triple Double!

00:03:26.833 --> 00:03:31.166
-Russ passes to…Russ?! And oh my god, Russ takes it home!

00:03:32.166 --> 00:03:34.083
-Activate: The Klaw.

00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:36.291
- Oh my, the crowd goes wild

00:03:36.291 --> 00:03:39.500
for the first defensive move of the entire tournament!

00:03:41.291 --> 00:03:44.791
-Wa ha ha ha. This is fun.

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:47.833
-And I can’t believe it. Even the Traveller is here…

00:03:47.833 --> 00:03:48.500
for now.

00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:54.958
-Perfect.

00:03:54.958 --> 00:03:59.250
This tournament is just one more boost 
in my resume against..

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.875
 him.

